        "original_id": "b0a9cce8-8f0a-565d-b9a2-8fb4061bde82",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: We Were Soldiers Once… And Young, We Were Soldiers\n- People: Hal Moore\n- Roles: Lieutenant General (Ret.)\n- Concepts: Distinguished Service Cross, West Point class of 1945\n\nFacts:\n- Hal Moore was a member of the West Point class of 1945.\n- In 1992, Hal Moore, identified as a Lieutenant General (Ret.), was a co-author of the book \"We Were Soldiers Once… And Young.\"\n- The film \"We Were Soldiers\" is based on the 1992 book \"We Were Soldiers Once… And Young.\"\n- Hal Moore received the Distinguished Service Cross, the United States military's second-highest decoration for valor.\n- Hal Moore was the first member of his West Point class of 1945 to be promoted to brigadier general, major general, and lieutenant general.",
